              "GEN.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 7.13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yucepu diyo cwinye doŋ oloye woko ki i nyim lwak ducu ma gucuŋ ka ŋete, ci odaŋŋe ni, “Wumi dano ducu gua woko ki bota, guciti.” Kit meno ŋatti mo yam pe odoŋ bote i kare ma en nyutte kekene bot omegine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ocako koko matek ma Luejipt bene giwinyo, ki jo ma i gaŋ kal pa Parao bene guwinyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yucepu owaco bot omegine ni, “An a Yucepu; wora mono pud tye makwo?” Ento omegine pe gitwero gamo doge, pien tipo komgi oto woko i nyime.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yucepu owaco bot omegine ni, “Alegowu, wubin bota cok.” Gucito cok bote. Owacogi ni, “An aye ominwu Yucepu, ma yam wucato i Ejipt. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe doŋ wubed ki cwercwiny, pe cwinywu owaŋ i komwu kekenwu pi cato an kany; pien Lubaŋa aye yam ocwala kany i nyimwu, wek akony kwowu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien kec doŋ obedo i lobo pi mwaka aryo; pud dok odoŋ mwaka abic ma pur ki kac bibedo pe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lubaŋa ocwalo an i nyimwu wek agwok ki wun jo ma bidoŋ wi lobo, ki pi gwoko ki wun jo mapol ma gibibwot makwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pien wun aye yam pe wucwala kany, ento Lubaŋa gire; omiyo an adoko won Parao, ki lalo ode ducu ki lalo lobo Ejipt ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tic 7.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wutim oyot, wucit bot wora, wuciwacce ni, ‘Latinni Yucepu owaco kuman ni, Lubaŋa oketa abedo laloyo i Ejipt ducu; bin bota kany, pe dok iru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibibedo i lobo Gocen, ibibedo cok kweda, in ki litinoni ki litino pa litinoni ducu, ki dyegini ki dyani-gu ki gin ma itye kwedgi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abipito in kunnu pien pud dok odoŋ mwaka me kec mukene abic i anyim; wek in ki jo ma i paconi, ki gin ma it ye kwedgi ducu pe wubed lucan.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo, kombeddi waŋjwu oneno, ki waŋ omera Benjamin bene oneno ni an kikoma aye aloko kwedwu ki doga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myero wun wucitit bot wora kit deyona ducu ma atye kwede i Ejipt, ki gin ducu ma doŋ wuneno. Wucit oyot, wek wukel wora kany.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ocako poto i ŋut ominne Benjamin ki koko, ki Benjamin bene okok i ŋute, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka onoto lem omegine ducu kun kok; ka doŋ lacen omegine gucako boko lok kwede.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka lok owinnye wa ki i ot pa Parao ni, “Omegi Yucepu gubino”, pire oyomo cwiny Parao ki luticce matek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Parao owaco bot Yucepu ni, “Wac bot omegini ni, ‘Wutim kit man, wutwe yec i ŋe kanawu, wudok cen i lobo Kanaan; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wutiŋ wonwu ki jowu, wek wubin bota; abimiyowu gin mabeco ma tye i lobo Ejipt, wucicamo moo ma i lobo-ni.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Dok icikgi ni, ‘Wutim kit man: Wuter gadigadi nia ki i lobo Ejipt kany pi litinowu matino ki pi mon mewu, wek wukel wonwu obin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe wupar pi jamiwu, pien gin mabeco ma tye i lobo Ejipt ducu mewu.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awobe pa Icrael gutiyo kit meno; Yucepu omiyogi gadigadi kit macalo Parao ociko, ka dok omiyogi peke me wotgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omiyo botgi ducu ŋat acel acel boŋŋi mabeco me aruka i nino madito, ento bot Benjamin omiyo cekel me ryal miya adek ki ruk mabeco abic me nino madito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ocwalo bot wonne jami macalo man: Kana apar ma guyene ki jami mabeco ma oa ki i Ejipt, ki megi kana apar ma guyeyo kal, ki cam, ki peke me wot pa wongi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka doŋ ocako cwalo omegine gucito. Ka doŋ gia ocikogi ni, “Pe wubed ka da iyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gua woko ki i Ejipt, ci gudwogo i lo bo Kanaan bot wongi Yakobo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka gutitte ni, “Yucepu pud tye makwo, en aye laloyo i lobo Ejipt ducu”; ci tipo kome oto woko lirut, pien onoŋo peya oye lokgi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka doŋ gutitte lok kom Yucepu ducu, kit ma ocikogi kwede, ka dok pi neno lwak gadigadi ma Yucepu ocwalo pi tiŋo en, ka tipo kom wongi ocako dwogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 45:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka Icrael ocako lok ni, “Doŋ otum, woda Yucepu kara pud tye makwo; abiwot acito ka nene ma pud peya ato.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.45.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.45.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
